{%- comment -%}
  LANE ROUTE — LEARN HOW IT WORKS
  Route: /pages/learn-how-it-works
  Built 2026-09-19, STORE_MOVEMENT_SPRINT_004.

  WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: the five lanes previously existed only as on-page anchors
  (#er-how) inside er-experience-home.liquid. An anchor scrolls; it does not route.
  A visitor clicking a lane went nowhere.

  WHY THE LIST IS HARD-CODED: Shopify does not expose DRAFT products to Liquid.
