{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="er-lane" id="er-how">
  <div class="er-lane-wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">LEARN HOW IT WORKS</p>
    <h1>The method, shown working, not described.</h1>
    <ul class="lane-list">
      <li class="row soon">
        <span class="t">Build a World From One Idea — THYLORA Starter Kit</span>
        <span class="meta"><span class="price">$19.00</span><span class="badge">COMING SOON</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="row dev">
        <span class="t">C&W Vehicle Civilization — Engineering Notebook Vol. 1</span>
        <span class="meta"><span class="price">$29.00</span><span class="badge">IN DEVELOPMENT</span></span>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="honest">Items marked COMING SOON are finished or nearly finished and are not yet
      open for purchase. Items marked IN DEVELOPMENT are still being built. Only items marked
      AVAILABLE NOW can be bought today.</p>
    <a class="back" href="/">&larr; All five lanes</a>
  </div>
</section>

